{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And Joseph and Rachel drew near.</b> It is the way of Scripture to mention the man first, but above, since it said ואת לאה וילדיה, it likewise said ואת רחל ואת יוסף. And if you ask: why did he not hide her in a chest as he did for Dinah? One may answer: all the seed of Abraham were scrupulous regarding a married woman, and on this account Joseph did not attach himself and grew numerous before his mother."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:12.056514209Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}